ghost-role-terror-spider-name = Terror spider
ghost-role-terror-spider-description = The task of the Terror Spider is to destroy the station and everything alive on it.
ghost-role-terror-spider-rules = You are a [color=red][bold]Team Antagonist[/bold][/color] with all other terror spiders.

ghost-role-information-ntnc-consortium-officer-name = NanoTrasen Navy Corps Marine
ghost-role-information-ntnc-consortium-officer-description = You are charged directly from the NanoTrasen Navy Corps to protect and serve the Central Command officials at all costs, nothing else subverts that.

ghost-role-information-ntsf-name = NTSF Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-description = You are a NanoTrasen Special Forces operative, the best NanoTrasen has to offer. Protect NT assets, enforce NT law, and leave no survivors who threaten the bottom line.
ghost-role-information-ntsf-primus-name = NTSF Primus Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-primus-description = You are a member of Task Force One "Primus" — the absolute best NanoTrasen has to offer. Protect NT assets and enforce NT law at any cost.
ghost-role-information-ntsf-secundus-name = NTSF Secundus Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-secundus-description = You are a member of Task Force "Secundus", the steamroller of NanoTrasen. Your reinforced armor is your weapon crush all opposition.
ghost-role-information-ntsf-tertius-name = NTSF Tertius Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-tertius-description = You are a member of Task Force "Tertius", the Repo Men of NanoTrasen. Take what is theirs and usually plenty more.
ghost-role-information-ntsf-quartus-name = NTSF Quartus Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-quartus-description = You are a member of Task Force "Quartus", guardians of the most dangerous transports and volatile cargo NanoTrasen moves.
ghost-role-information-ntsf-quintus-name = NTSF Quintus Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-quintus-description = You are a member of Task Force "Quintus", specialists in Syndicate countermeasures. There are no better Gorlex skull-crushers in the galaxy.
ghost-role-information-ntsf-sextus-name = NTSF Sextus Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-sextus-description = You are a member of Task Force "Sextus". Your esoteric gold-inlaid armor tells a story your enemies will never finish reading.
ghost-role-information-ntsf-septimus-name = NTSF Septimus Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-septimus-description = You are a member of Task Force "Septimus". You are pest control and this pulse carbine is your pest control.
ghost-role-information-ntsf-octavius-name = NTSF Octavius Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-octavius-description = You are a member of Task Force "Octavius". Start prayin', because you're here to make sure nobody else has to.
ghost-role-information-ntsf-nonus-name = NTSF Nonus Operative
ghost-role-information-ntsf-nonus-description = You are a member of Task Force "Nonus". May NanoTrasen have mercy, for you have none.

